SUMMARY:CPB — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: CAMPBELL S CO & THE (CPB)\nRoadshow: URL: www.netroadshow.com | En
 try Code: CPB2026 | Direct Link: www.netroadshow.com/nrs/home/#!/?show=a56
 12748\n\nDeal context:\nThe Campbell's Company (CPB)\, rated Baa3(neg)/BBB
 -(neg)/BBB-(neg) at the issuer level\, is conducting fixed income investor
  calls on September 30\, 2026 ahead of an SEC-registered 30.5NC5.25 Fixed-
 to-Fixed Reset Rate Junior Subordinated Notes offering with a coupon floor
  provision\, with expected ratings of Ba1/BB/BB — reflecting the subordina
 ted nature of the instrument relative to the issuer's senior ratings. The 
 deal is arranged by Barclays\, BNP Paribas\, BofA Securities\, Citigroup\,
  J.P. Morgan\, and UBS Investment Bank\, with BofA Securities and Citigrou
 p coordinating logistics. No size\, pricing\, or spread guidance has been 
 disclosed at this stage\; the offering is subject to market conditions and
  is expected to follow the investor calls.
